              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Anyana kaIsarela akate ekaŋa wejima wawu, awa kumpandelu yawu, awa kumpandelu yawu, kuyilukishu yamavumu awankakulula jawu; akate-ekaŋa kwakwihinetenti dakubulakena kwi-ndo.",
          "type": "text",
