          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achindiluwu kuchilombu chaRubeni, ashikili mumakombakaji nkulakaji namakumi atanu nekombakaji dimu, namakulakaji awana namakumi atanu, mwahita majitawu. Dichichendu chamuchiyedi.",
          "type": "text",
