        {
          "text": "Himukulondela itenti dakubulakena hamu nachilombu chawaLevi, mukachi kayilombu mwate ekela ŋawu dimu mwakanya mukila ŋawu nawa, awa nahawu, awa nahawu, kumpandelu jawu, kumpandelu jawu.",
