            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumutamba wakumujika diku kwakekalaŋa mpandelu yachilombu chaEfweremi mwahita majitawu. Kalamba kawanyana kaEfweremi yowu Elishama mwana kaAmihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
