          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achindiluwu kuchilombu chaEfweremi ashikili mumakombakaji nkulakaji namakombakaji atanu nasatu, nankulakaji yimu, mwahita majitawu. Dichi chendu chamuchisatu.",
