            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumutamba wakukabeta kakuchimunswa, diku kwakekalaŋa mpandeluya chilombu chaDani mwahita majitawu. Kalamba kawanyana kaDani, yowu Ahiyezeri mwana kaAmishadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
